flowchart LR
  B[Agent / Reactive Behavior] --> P[Proposal]
  P --> V[Validation]
  V --> POL[Policy]
  POL -->|requires| H[Human Approval]
  H --> CAP[Capability Gateway]
  POL -->|allow| CAP
  POL -->|deny| DEN[Denial Event]
  CAP --> EXT[External Side Effect]
  EXT --> PC[Postcondition Verify]
  PC --> REC[Receipt + Evidence]
  REC --> LED[(Ledger)]
